    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Watch the corners. Fresh work deserves a little care.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_bye_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_bye_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_bye_01_v03",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Go carefully around the doorframe.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_bye_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_bye_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_bye_01_v04",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Safe travels. Give your seams a look before you leave.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_bye_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_bye_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_bye_01_v05",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Mind the edges on the road.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_bye_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_bye_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_bye_01_v06",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Take care of the things that carry you.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_bye_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_bye_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_active",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "A local delivery to sort. First the bindings, then the contents. A damaged handle tells you where to start.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_active",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_active.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_active_v02",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "The delivery's being sorted. I look at the bindings before I look inside.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_active",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_active_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_active_v03",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "They're sorting crates. A worn handle usually tells me where to begin.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_active",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_active_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_active_v04",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "A delivery in the square. First I check what held it together on the road.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_active",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_active_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_active_v05",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "The crates are being sorted. Look at their straps before trusting their weight.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_active",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_active_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_active_v06",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "We're sorting the delivery. Good contents still need sound handles.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_active",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_active_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_finished",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "The delivery has been received. Those crates will stay here while we decide where everything belongs.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_finished.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_finished_v02",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "The delivery has arrived. We'll leave the crates here until there's a place for their contents.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_finished_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_finished_v03",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "Those crates are received. Unpacking can wait until we know where to put things.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_finished_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_finished_v04",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "The delivery's in. I'd rather plan a shelf than empty a crate onto the ground.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_finished_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_finished_v05",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "The crates will stand here for now. Deciding where things belong takes longer than opening them.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_finished_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_delivery_finished_v06",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "We've received everything. The square can hold the crates while we sort out their next homes.",
    "variant_group": "mender_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_delivery_finished_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_guild_01",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "If your guild writes about a strange old tool, draw the handle too. Someone held it. I'd like to know how.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_guild_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_guild_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_guild_01_v02",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "When you draw an old tool for the guild, show me the worn parts. That's where the hands were.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_guild_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_guild_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_guild_01_v03",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Copy the handle as carefully as the mysterious marks. Somebody had to hold the thing.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_guild_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_guild_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_guild_01_v04",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Your guild can tell me where a tool was found. I'd also like to know how its owner used it.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_guild_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_guild_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_guild_01_v05",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "If you bring back a sketch, leave room for the grip and the repairs.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_guild_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_guild_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_guild_01_v06",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "A strange tool still has weight and edges. Put those in your account; a mender will thank you.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_guild_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_guild_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_hello_01",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Let me finish this seam. It has strong opinions.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_hello_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_hello_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_hello_01_v02",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "One moment. This seam keeps opening where I thought I'd finished.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_hello_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_hello_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_hello_01_v03",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Let me tie this off before we talk.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_hello_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_hello_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_hello_01_v04",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Hold your story a moment. I'm trying to persuade these edges to meet.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_hello_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_hello_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_hello_01_v05",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "I'll listen as soon as this stitch stops arguing.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_hello_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_hello_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_hello_01_v06",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "A moment, please. The seam has had more to say than the customer.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_hello_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_hello_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_magic_01",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_magic",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "An old enchantment can keep doing its job after everyone forgets what the job was.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_magic_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_magic_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_magic_01_v02",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_magic",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Some enchantments keep working long after anyone remembers why they were made.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_magic_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_magic_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_magic_01_v03",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_magic",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "An old working can outlast its instructions. That's when people bring it to me.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_magic_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_magic_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_magic_01_v04",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_magic",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "The maker dies, the job is forgotten, and the spell carries on. It can make repairs complicated.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_magic_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_magic_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_magic_01_v05",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_magic",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "I ask what an enchantment was meant to do before I decide what has gone wrong.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_magic_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_magic_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_magic_01_v06",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_magic",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "A spell can be perfectly obedient to an order nobody needs anymore.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_magic_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_magic_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_neighbors_01",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Two households can spend a year arguing over a gate and still ask the same mender to fix it. I send each of them half the bill.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_neighbors_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_neighbors_01_v02",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "A disputed gate still needs a sound hinge. I charge each household for half.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_neighbors_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_neighbors_01_v03",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Neighbors arguing over a gate agree on one thing: I should mend it. Then they argue about the bill.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_neighbors_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_neighbors_01_v04",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "I've repaired a gate while both households explained why it belonged to the other.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_neighbors_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_neighbors_01_v05",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Two households can disagree over a gate for years. The wood doesn't improve while they wait.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_neighbors_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_neighbors_01_v06",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "I mend the shared gate, send half the bill each way, and let the neighbors choose what to argue about next.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "mender_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_neighbors_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_active",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper active",
    "text": "Supper is being set out. I inspect a cup before I fill it. Occupational habit.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_active",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_active.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_active_v02",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper active",
    "text": "Supper is going out. I always check a cup's rim before using it.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_active",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_active_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_active_v03",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper active",
    "text": "They're setting supper by the fountain. I'll look for cracks before I pour anything.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_active",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_active_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_active_v04",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper active",
    "text": "The table is being laid. A quick look at the cups won't delay me long.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_active",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_active_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_active_v05",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper active",
    "text": "Supper's on its way out. I can't quite stop checking the handles.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_active",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_active_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_active_v06",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper active",
    "text": "We're setting out a meal. I trust a cup more once I've turned it in my hand.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_active",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_active_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_finished",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper finished",
    "text": "Supper has finished. Warm cups cool at their own pace. So do people.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_finished",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_finished.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_finished_v02",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper finished",
    "text": "The meal is over. Let the cups cool before putting them away.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_finished",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_finished_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_finished_v03",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper finished",
    "text": "Supper's finished. The cups and their users can take their time cooling down.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_finished",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_finished_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_finished_v04",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper finished",
    "text": "The table has emptied. I leave a warm cup alone for a little while.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_finished",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.mender_supper_finished_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "mender_supper_finished_v05",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "relic_mender",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Town supper finished",
    "text": "After supper, even a good cup deserves time on the shelf.",
    "variant_group": "mender_supper_finished",
